      "content": "Candleholders with a single candle socket mounted on a support with a widened base or foot for balance; often the support is columnar in form. For candleholders with a single candle socket set on a flat saucer or traylike base, use \"chambersticks.\" [Source: Getty AAT] | Candleholders with two or more arms. [Source: Getty AAT]"
